      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Little between a host of chances. DISSALTO (9) doesn't win out of turn but is rarely far away. Had his first try on this course last time and boxed on well for a close-up fourth in a similar event. Best figures stack up and should feature in the finish. JUST PLAIN NUTS (1) gave a big sight last time here in the same race and was run over late, finishing third. Low draw and will be in this for a long way again. GEEGEES MERCEDES (6) comes off a run on the synthetic at Devonport when on speed and game in defeat, going down a head. Tricky gate but down in weight and leading rider aboard. OUT OF THE SPHERE (3) got off the mark last time on the synthetic with an all-the-way win. Will give a sight again. MISS LYRA (7) finished just ahead of DISSALTO and JUST PLAIN NUTS last time and is one of the better chances again.",
